# (electronic) [[circuit]], [[circuitry]]
#: {{syn|ru|электро́нная схе́ма}}
# [[scheme]], [[plan]], [[pattern]], [[framework]], [[model]], [[regimen]] {{gl|order or method of an action, flow of a process}}
